        <mxCell id="turn-context-note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacing=14;fontSize=16;fontColor=#17202A;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;sketch=1;fillStyle=solid;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;" value="Observe separately with GET /turns/{id}/events. Up to four observers receive coalesced committed revisions.&#10;A disconnect or revoked cookie detaches observation. Stop cancels the retained worker and saves its terminal state.&#10;&#10;Successful identical reads reuse evidence IDs within the turn. Every continued turn collects fresh evidence.&#10;Only successful question/summary pairs enter model context: ten whole pairs, at most 32,000 characters.&#10;Restart interrupts abandoned work without generation. Saved traces omit response previews and native replay data." vertex="1">
