        <mxCell id="action-crash-note" value="SQLiteActions hydrates detached PreparedAction values. Domain rules validate transitions.&#10;No transaction spans Docker. Claim, marker, and terminal writes include authoritative audit.&#10;Crash before marker: fail claim and release guard. Crash after marker: indeterminate + durable block.&#10;Late SDK results do not rewrite indeterminate outcomes. Reconciliation never resends Docker." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#17202A;strokeWidth=2;sketch=1;fillStyle=solid;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
